y the following steps:\n\n- Take the curve $y=-\\frac{1}{x}.$\n\n![](images/9d/9da0db2e6c97e507e82b7ca801e46802fabf91ad31ff53ad3cc9ae580151370a.png)\n\n- Translate it by $2$ units to the right to get the graph of $y=-\\frac{1}{x-2}.$\n\n![](images/3c/3c8dd0e4726747b00e4377e43c06693326e10db2977257c9c20da4953127ddfd.png)\n\n- Then, stretch the result by a scale factor of $2$ parallel to the $y$-axis to get the graph of $y=-\\frac{2}{x-2}.$\n\n![](images/20/207dec9757b65a75c25ba7ace7a12bec8e922bda9018e58d6511d12de47426b7.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186362262 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4640f978-9caa-5960-bec4-f153a1b4cc5d" :knowledge-point/title "Graphing a Transformed Reciprocal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07cd176e-45f5-59e1-938e-cb5c17a1841f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/25/259f3b708829f6a814bc4937b44349b91e55ec5b4fb0f73d39b4c993287dabbd.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186360864} {:answer/id #uuid "5500285e-6a8d-5d84-b380-63839c0a769d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a6/a64e70fd5a6680fbf2ccb3236e64cbc51a014e9eecf6596d418e5a18a34fdfe6.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186361216} {:answer/id #uuid "ae28cbaf-9dd9-5a43-9809-d10c09f499d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/9c/9c7701cbc6cdca05f3feed2c006837f5d057196b4617d1b5bb507b85ada04a68.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186361608} {:answer/id #uuid "c6ebb996-b151-5bd0-a95e-91475e73e29d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/62/626fbb611d42800337f0b512cdb0e221e64808ec22e0b434c3bf3c1e6d9386cc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186361736} {:answer/id #uuid "dfae3d18-485c-5018-818c-316dd7cabefe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/08/08925ef549329dc44ae8dc1711f101d6a2ffbbfa2c4fa225a6d21dccc458bb00.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186361836}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dfae3d18-485c-5018-818c-316dd7cabefe" :an